  ('b65bb3d9-2c7b-4db2-bff1-c1f55ce713be'::uuid, 'Prakash, could you say more about how you handled global standard? Last semester''s reading group went through “The Need for a Global Standard of Artificial Intelligence…”, and most of the debate centred on global standard. Which metric did you prioritise, and does the ranking change if you pick another one?', 'cc53c7cc-30d0-40b2-bc77-36c6c74e9fe2'::uuid, '2026-10-15T04:04:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
