  ('46662c92-0196-4682-92c3-908bac1e4322'::uuid, 'Interesting thread. My first reaction is that the complexity piece is doing most of the heavy lifting here. Liability and transparency around public policy are still unsettled, and this paper does not address them. For context, the artificial intelligence regulation literature has been debating a very similar question for some time.', NULL::uuid, '2026-10-08T22:57:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
