  ('44394aa9-7b56-4fd7-a3a1-c62f650949d4'::uuid, 'This lines up with what we have seen when applying artificial intelligence regulation in practice. There is a useful parallel with cyber law, where the role of important role is comparable. I would suggest a pilot on a small subset first, then scale up if the artificial intelligence regulation results hold.', NULL::uuid, '2026-08-09T05:24:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
