  ('ce82c873-dbe5-4392-8488-9aecc3dec485'::uuid, 'Nice find, and a good reminder that the international data privacy law question deserves more attention than it gets. It is not clear how much of the improvement comes from boundaries versus simply more tuning.', NULL::uuid, '2026-09-26T00:32:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
