  ('aca14885-64d4-4fb5-98b9-c5cf85090ef8'::uuid, 'This is a timely question, and we ran into something similar while working on supply chain analytics. Consider tracking sustainability separately so that regressions are easier to spot. Did you check how it performs when the input around application is noisy or partially missing?', NULL::uuid, '2026-11-15T05:02:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('4a111036-15f8-4187-9e8b-25a12c02df78'::uuid, 'I would gently disagree, Ishita: the evidence for agriculture is thinner than it looks. The social context of supply chain analytics is largely absent here, and I think it changes how we should read the findings. How sensitive is it to the choice of hyperparameters?', 'aca14885-64d4-4fb5-98b9-c5cf85090ef8'::uuid, '2026-11-17T23:11:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
