  ('05221cc6-4cf2-413e-87f4-c1bc7a55eb9e'::uuid, 'Thanks for pushing on this, Siddharth; I''ll report back once I have numbers for public policy. From a management perspective, the interesting part is the cost-benefit: what would adopting public policy change for a firm''s decisions?', '4a3f86a5-077f-4bd9-a796-eaf7d20c0584'::uuid, '2026-11-03T01:45:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('74ec7c65-da58-4333-95de-e5d22c941f7b'::uuid, 'Nice find, and a good reminder that the deploying supply chain analytics question deserves more attention than it gets. The comparison would be more convincing with a stronger baseline and a proper ablation of benefits. Has anyone compared this against a simple baseline for supply chain analytics?', NULL::uuid, '2026-09-15T13:08:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('a1d1c956-ba20-4333-b74a-9aedfcd6737d'::uuid, 'I have been following this line of work on supply chain analytics for a while, so I''m glad it came up. We saw noticeable sensitivity to random seeds, so I would report results over several runs. It is not clear how much of the improvement comes from benefits versus simply more tuning.', NULL::uuid, '2026-09-13T04:56:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('05791341-66eb-4d29-b705-cc7de37fa9b2'::uuid, 'Thanks Yash, this is exactly the feedback I was hoping for. What would it take to adapt this to a different domain, say data privacy law?', 'a1d1c956-ba20-4333-b74a-9aedfcd6737d'::uuid, '2026-09-13T13:22:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('05a253db-1e6f-4f7e-9723-dc3fba06825f'::uuid, 'Appreciate you sharing this with the group. In our group we used inventing protein folds on a small protein folding dataset, and the gains were modest but consistent. Is there a public dataset we could use to test inventing protein folds ourselves? Happy to share my notes if that helps.', NULL::uuid, '2026-08-30T10:49:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('232997f3-6125-4338-9b49-5a633c651d0f'::uuid, 'Great discussion starter; the core idea around inventing protein folds is easy to underestimate. I would want evidence that inventing protein folds translates into measurable business outcomes, not only better metrics. Is there a public dataset we could use to test inventing protein folds ourselves?', NULL::uuid, '2026-09-01T03:29:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('c79a2178-6881-41bf-bd38-ef4f7486d68b'::uuid, 'It could be worth pairing this with ideas from VLSI design; the overlap with inventing protein folds looks real.', NULL::uuid, '2026-09-02T23:51:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('4fb7a254-dc70-41e4-ba45-4b0d0bbe212e'::uuid, 'Nice find, and a good reminder that the inventing protein folds question deserves more attention than it gets. Is there a public dataset we could use to test inventing protein folds ourselves? We saw noticeable sensitivity to random seeds, so I would report results over several runs.', NULL::uuid, '2026-09-07T19:08:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
