  ('d8befb5a-4d99-4e97-a2d1-2329d8651c31'::uuid, 'Good point, Ananya; I had not considered that angle on protein folding. On our side the g-quadruplexes rescuing protein folding step was the bottleneck, not the main method. There is a useful parallel with artificial intelligence regulation, where the role of g-quadruplexes rescuing protein folding is comparable. Sharing a few references in the group folder later this week.', '05ab814a-3a91-4a61-993b-d4783d1d821a'::uuid, '2026-11-04T01:41:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
