  ('391f358a-ed24-4d55-8e03-a5298d5bf8b3'::uuid, 'Interesting thread. My first reaction is that the g-quadruplexes rescuing protein folding piece is doing most of the heavy lifting here. A colleague''s project on protein folding hit the same issue with g-quadruplexes rescuing protein folding.', NULL::uuid, '2026-11-03T16:09:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
