  ('e6d93f90-567c-44ab-9639-e49335acd98d'::uuid, 'Thanks for bringing this up; the paper is a useful lens on protein folding. The recent papers in our library on data mining would make a good companion read. Has anyone compared this against a simple baseline for protein folding?', NULL::uuid, '2026-11-03T11:26:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
