  ('295391f1-2acb-413c-a557-353764193935'::uuid, 'Good point, Lakshmi; I had not considered that angle on consumer behavior. Liability and transparency around consumer behavior are still unsettled, and this paper does not address them.', '410c12db-bf7f-4155-89a5-f63a247b3901'::uuid, '2026-07-28T20:43:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('07b5da9a-8662-4458-a1b9-2e40892f71df'::uuid, 'Worth discussing properly, because the topic of consumer behavior keeps coming up in our seminars. Has anyone compared this against a simple baseline for consumer behavior?', NULL::uuid, '2026-07-26T01:10:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('7dbdf1a7-9b67-47bb-852a-23749ed497f5'::uuid, 'Thanks Lakshmi, that clarifies the future research agenda part for me. My main concern is whether the evaluation reflects realistic conditions for consumer behavior. We reproduced part of this for consumer behavior and the trend held, although the absolute numbers were lower.', '410c12db-bf7f-4155-89a5-f63a247b3901'::uuid, '2026-07-28T08:43:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('f19b39b8-4c82-4f0c-8cba-1c52c1ba41f0'::uuid, 'Fair objection, Lakshmi, though I think it depends on the dataset. If you are open to it, we could draft a short comparison note for the reading group.', '410c12db-bf7f-4155-89a5-f63a247b3901'::uuid, '2026-07-26T15:26:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('baa93e48-e3f2-4e3f-834e-8459fa4c070e'::uuid, 'I think the interesting part of “Research Progress on the Synthetic Biology of Botanical Biopesticides” is less the headline number and more how it handles research progress. Our lab has been collecting notes on botanical biopesticides; the picture is more nuanced than the abstract suggests.', NULL::uuid, '2026-06-05T08:33:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('07c6521e-b535-4120-a70d-112e255f1b65'::uuid, 'Rahul, this is the kind of detail that rarely makes it into the paper. This connects to the work on data mining, which tackles a similar trade-off from a different direction.', 'baa93e48-e3f2-4e3f-834e-8459fa4c070e'::uuid, '2026-06-07T15:46:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('92542be2-d6d1-4e71-bed1-17350e86d5ba'::uuid, 'Good question. I read “CRISPR gene editing to improve crop resistance to parasitic…” a few weeks ago and it has stayed with me. It could be worth pairing this with ideas from consumer behavior; the overlap with improve crop resistance looks real. I would want evidence that parasitic plants translates into measurable business outcomes, not only better metrics.', NULL::uuid, '2026-06-18T18:02:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('deb2460f-8aab-4b1a-8b17-9b8ed03dc792'::uuid, 'Aishwarya, could you say more about how you handled improve crop resistance? Last semester''s reading group went through the paper, and most of the debate centred on parasitic plants. The recent papers in our library on media studies would make a good companion read.', '92542be2-d6d1-4e71-bed1-17350e86d5ba'::uuid, '2026-06-19T14:38:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('08dfa665-0b91-4343-87bf-f4b3fe1e6ad2'::uuid, 'Quick note before the details: I''m reading this mostly from a engineering point of view. The recent papers in our library on digital humanities would make a good companion read.', NULL::uuid, '2026-06-24T15:53:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('ba8f39ce-1e9e-435f-b369-44f12b6ea084'::uuid, 'Good question. I read “CRISPR gene editing to improve crop resistance to parasitic…” a few weeks ago and it has stayed with me. I would flag the privacy and public-policy implications of parasitic plants before anyone builds on it.', NULL::uuid, '2026-06-20T13:06:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('081e6970-a4b0-4695-a9d0-c96cc2096350'::uuid, 'I have been following this line of work on CRISPR gene editing for a while, so I''m glad it came up. This connects to the work on media studies, which tackles a similar trade-off from a different direction. It would help to state the assumptions behind parasitic plants formally and check which of them actually hold.', NULL::uuid, '2026-06-18T09:19:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
