  ('83e719e0-b72c-4b39-b5e1-75818a60d0fc'::uuid, 'Thanks for bringing this up; “The evolution of embedded systems in automotive industry” is a useful lens on embedded systems. Is there a public dataset we could use to test automotive industry ourselves? Several of the reported gains are small enough that they could disappear under a different split.', NULL::uuid, '2026-07-27T01:37:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('499c00f9-f5e6-45aa-b415-939d17bf6251'::uuid, 'I see it a little differently, Rekha. There is a useful parallel with digital humanities, where the role of evolution is comparable. It would help to state the assumptions behind automotive industry formally and check which of them actually hold. Looking forward to hearing what others think.', '53b6e664-8b9f-4677-a8e8-bc15d6f9198c'::uuid, '2026-07-30T11:56:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('090b41da-725c-4c20-9a18-72732fe242bd'::uuid, 'Helpful context, Rekha. When we tried a similar setup for embedded systems, preprocessing choices changed the outcome more than the model did. Liability and transparency around embedded systems are still unsettled, and this paper does not address them. Sharing a few references in the group folder later this week.', '83e719e0-b72c-4b39-b5e1-75818a60d0fc'::uuid, '2026-07-29T14:58:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('db592a69-5a59-4d54-b720-612700406983'::uuid, 'I have been following this line of work on bioinformatics for a while, so I''m glad it came up. Consider tracking bioinformatics separately so that regressions are easier to spot. We saw noticeable sensitivity to random seeds, so I would report results over several runs.', NULL::uuid, '2026-07-08T05:01:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('091bf063-3491-4f4a-b39e-6d64ee640285'::uuid, 'This is a timely question, and we ran into something similar while working on bioinformatics. Adoption is usually limited by process and incentives, so any plan to adopt bioinformatics needs a realistic rollout story.', NULL::uuid, '2026-07-05T10:50:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('54813ac4-0063-4d9d-a857-e80e211a0a6a'::uuid, 'That is a fair summary, Aditya, but one detail about bioinformatics is missing. From a statistical point of view, I would want to see uncertainty estimates around the bioinformatics results, not only point values.', '091bf063-3491-4f4a-b39e-6d64ee640285'::uuid, '2026-07-05T16:45:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('c5ff4e9a-b740-406b-83c3-62df9401cfd5'::uuid, 'Agreed with Aditya on the main point. Last semester''s reading group went through “Introduction of bioinformatics”, and most of the debate centred on bioinformatics. Reporting confidence intervals would make the claims around bioinformatics easier to trust.', '091bf063-3491-4f4a-b39e-6d64ee640285'::uuid, '2026-07-06T04:15:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
