  ('d2faab49-087e-4bff-83a6-0e22535e8ad3'::uuid, 'I skimmed the paper last week, and the framing of marketing analytics is the part I would discuss first. From a statistical point of view, I would want to see uncertainty estimates around the supply chain analytics results, not only point values.', NULL::uuid, '2026-11-24T06:40:11.587261+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
