  ('ef2850be-2c57-4cb2-8e6b-0af3883fb07e'::uuid, 'This is a timely question, and we ran into something similar while working on supply chain analytics. Do the authors say anything about computational cost for marketing analytics? It could be worth pairing this with ideas from computer vision; the overlap with marketing analytics looks real.', NULL::uuid, '2026-11-24T06:40:11.587261+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('6f874c24-15d0-4297-bb1e-8c2b6644d0c8'::uuid, 'Good point, Deepak; I had not considered that angle on supply chain analytics. The comparison would be more convincing with a stronger baseline and a proper ablation of marketing analytics. This connects to the work on synthetic biology, which tackles a similar trade-off from a different direction.', '0c4e736c-b5c6-4ec3-b10e-523f491ad8d9'::uuid, '2026-11-21T12:22:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('eb20ecda-2016-474e-9d6d-b7d494ac1fb5'::uuid, 'I would gently disagree, Tarun: the evidence for marketing analytics is thinner than it looks. What would it take to adapt this to a different domain, say VLSI design? I would suggest a pilot on a small subset first, then scale up if the supply chain analytics results hold.', '6f874c24-15d0-4297-bb1e-8c2b6644d0c8'::uuid, '2026-11-23T07:07:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('e4eb8a7d-907f-4093-bc1a-81c8d0fa8f15'::uuid, 'Short answer from my side: it depends heavily on the data you start with. My main concern is whether the evaluation reflects realistic conditions for supply chain analytics.', NULL::uuid, '2026-11-24T06:40:11.587261+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('0b1fec73-c7f7-4e7f-b8f3-974c889a76fb'::uuid, 'Honest take: the results look promising, but I would hold off on strong conclusions. In a small pilot, the approach worked well on clean data and degraded quickly on messy real-world input. For context, the data mining literature has been debating a very similar question for some time. I will revisit this after I have had time to run a few experiments.', NULL::uuid, '2026-11-19T11:58:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('44b77597-f17a-4098-893a-6efb3a0d2ebc'::uuid, 'Appreciate you sharing this with the group. In a small pilot, the approach worked well on clean data and degraded quickly on messy real-world input.', NULL::uuid, '2026-11-22T14:41:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('29cdb0f7-1c1a-4af2-8b82-ecd304fea07b'::uuid, 'Helpful context, Tarun. The comparison would be more convincing with a stronger baseline and a proper ablation of marketing analytics. How does this compare with last year''s work on cyber law?', '6f874c24-15d0-4297-bb1e-8c2b6644d0c8'::uuid, '2026-11-24T06:29:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
