  ('e5f530c9-b63b-4bd2-837f-fcba56e4ea53'::uuid, 'Interesting thread. My first reaction is that the factors influencing fintech adoption piece is doing most of the heavy lifting here. How does this compare with last year''s work on media studies? It may help to add a qualitative error analysis alongside the headline metrics. Sharing a few references in the group folder later this week.', NULL::uuid, '2026-08-14T14:04:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
