  ('6cda7af5-5c70-431d-8f91-75a6ba52fd04'::uuid, 'Interesting thread. My first reaction is that the public policy piece is doing most of the heavy lifting here. There is a useful parallel with digital humanities, where the role of public policy is comparable.', NULL::uuid, '2026-09-25T23:46:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('11a66d5b-3d6b-4866-847d-e6f02d942dc0'::uuid, 'Interesting thread. My first reaction is that the public policy piece is doing most of the heavy lifting here. The recent papers in our library on digital humanities would make a good companion read. I would suggest a pilot on a small subset first, then scale up if the public policy results hold.', NULL::uuid, '2026-10-02T03:15:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
