  ('432d3bda-731e-4056-ac33-9605e0182666'::uuid, 'Worth discussing properly, because the topic of embedded systems keeps coming up in our seminars. Do the authors say anything about computational cost for desain embedded system? A cleaner experiment might isolate desain embedded system and keep everything else fixed.', NULL::uuid, '2026-06-17T01:34:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('11d034c0-64ae-4c34-b3e1-b3c5d4e846ad'::uuid, 'Great discussion starter; the core idea around desain embedded system is easy to underestimate. It would help to see how desain embedded system performs for smaller organisations with limited data.', NULL::uuid, '2026-06-21T00:09:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('ff1f9aad-3214-4407-8c89-5e620c799136'::uuid, 'Manish, could you say more about how you handled desain embedded system? Consider tracking desain embedded system separately so that regressions are easier to spot. Which metric did you prioritise, and does the ranking change if you pick another one?', '432d3bda-731e-4056-ac33-9605e0182666'::uuid, '2026-06-19T08:37:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('e80c3589-7b54-45d6-90ff-55f449efb065'::uuid, 'Fair objection, Manish, though I think it depends on the dataset.', '432d3bda-731e-4056-ac33-9605e0182666'::uuid, '2026-06-19T04:17:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('cdaa8a48-3216-4631-9bb7-ae19f472313c'::uuid, 'Short answer from my side: it depends heavily on the data you start with. For context, the wireless sensor networks literature has been debating a very similar question for some time. One option is to run a small ablation on desain embedded system and share the numbers with the group. Happy to share my notes if that helps.', NULL::uuid, '2026-06-20T02:43:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('41249ef2-b268-437a-8621-9598c4168f00'::uuid, 'Fair objection, Manish, though I think it depends on the dataset. It would be worth asking whose perspective is missing from the data behind desain embedded system.', '11d034c0-64ae-4c34-b3e1-b3c5d4e846ad'::uuid, '2026-06-22T08:01:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('8a10efbb-7f7a-40f5-a57f-35b24ddd11ec'::uuid, 'Interesting thread. My first reaction is that the desain embedded system piece is doing most of the heavy lifting here. I would flag the privacy and public-policy implications of desain embedded system before anyone builds on it. Did you check how it performs when the input around desain embedded system is noisy or partially missing?', NULL::uuid, '2026-06-18T03:48:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('a471d635-31f8-40e7-88a4-10edd0e58749'::uuid, 'This lines up with what we have seen when applying bioinformatics in practice. For context, the CRISPR gene editing literature has been debating a very similar question for some time. Several of the reported gains are small enough that they could disappear under a different split.', NULL::uuid, '2026-06-30T01:47:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('f23bcec1-d70d-4f9e-8f74-6ce26f11196e'::uuid, 'This lines up with what we have seen when applying bioinformatics in practice. How does this compare with last year''s work on digital humanities? It would be worth asking whose perspective is missing from the data behind opportunities. Keen to see follow-up results.', NULL::uuid, '2026-06-22T10:58:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('5c5eaf63-012b-4dfc-8c3e-d3ba575b1b98'::uuid, 'Appreciate the pointers, Sanya; I will try that on my next run. On our side the progress step was the bottleneck, not the main method.', 'f23bcec1-d70d-4f9e-8f74-6ce26f11196e'::uuid, '2026-06-23T19:07:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('5c87f95d-e3de-4b2f-b538-4e585daf2626'::uuid, 'Helpful context, Meera. This connects to the work on artificial intelligence regulation, which tackles a similar trade-off from a different direction. It is not clear how much of the improvement comes from progress versus simply more tuning.', 'a471d635-31f8-40e7-88a4-10edd0e58749'::uuid, '2026-07-02T10:11:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('c0566eba-c2a9-45a5-a83f-3c31557dab09'::uuid, 'Shreya, this is the kind of detail that rarely makes it into the paper. I would be cautious about generalising beyond the datasets reported in the paper. Last semester''s reading group went through “Progress and opportunities of foundation models in bioinformatics”, and most of the debate centred on progress.', '5c5eaf63-012b-4dfc-8c3e-d3ba575b1b98'::uuid, '2026-06-24T17:41:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('11d700b5-2357-4cf4-934b-05b0bde6ffa1'::uuid, 'Appreciate you sharing this with the group. I worry the benchmark is too close to the training setup to say much about bioinformatics in the wild.', NULL::uuid, '2026-06-25T01:10:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('7f8c5207-7823-46f9-911c-4e5f7c5f5aae'::uuid, 'Helpful context, Shreya. In our group we used progress on a small bioinformatics dataset, and the gains were modest but consistent. This connects to the work on sustainable finance, which tackles a similar trade-off from a different direction.', '5c5eaf63-012b-4dfc-8c3e-d3ba575b1b98'::uuid, '2026-06-24T14:40:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('cfeeaa96-a74f-4c4b-8eef-92fa4b8016f2'::uuid, 'Worth discussing properly, because the topic of fintech adoption keeps coming up in our seminars. The comparison would be more convincing with a stronger baseline and a proper ablation of consumer fintech adoption. How sensitive is it to the choice of hyperparameters?', NULL::uuid, '2026-09-19T23:33:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('7f4b15a2-dc29-4d8b-9172-4d2666c0c200'::uuid, 'Good point, Nandini; I had not considered that angle on fintech adoption.', 'cfeeaa96-a74f-4c4b-8eef-92fa4b8016f2'::uuid, '2026-09-22T23:31:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('3501a705-8b4f-4f7f-82f6-0fc7b9cf8666'::uuid, 'Appreciate you sharing this with the group. The limitations section is thin, especially regarding consumer fintech adoption. We reproduced part of this for fintech adoption and the trend held, although the absolute numbers were lower.', NULL::uuid, '2026-09-28T01:53:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('4044a5d6-5fe6-46db-a78a-e5d2fbc2ad75'::uuid, 'What would it take to adapt this to a different domain, say media studies?', NULL::uuid, '2026-09-28T02:01:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('3e7bf46c-02f8-4c30-b401-c5b53183a0aa'::uuid, 'I have been following this line of work on fintech adoption for a while, so I''m glad it came up. When we tried a similar setup for fintech adoption, preprocessing choices changed the outcome more than the model did. Related reading: surveys on cognitive psychology cover the background on consumer fintech adoption nicely. Looking forward to hearing what others think.', NULL::uuid, '2026-09-27T01:26:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('22111e33-aa00-4753-8ccc-c180edcdaa74'::uuid, 'Worth discussing properly, because the topic of fintech adoption keeps coming up in our seminars. Several of the reported gains are small enough that they could disappear under a different split. A sensitivity analysis would show how stable the conclusions about fintech adoption are to small changes in the data.', NULL::uuid, '2026-09-20T19:21:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('11de9719-ae86-4998-a39b-02515c7f8626'::uuid, 'This is a timely question, and we ran into something similar while working on fintech adoption. Consider tracking consumer fintech adoption separately so that regressions are easier to spot. When we tried a similar setup for fintech adoption, preprocessing choices changed the outcome more than the model did.', NULL::uuid, '2026-09-20T04:12:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('120361f9-0430-4302-8784-37465281bd57'::uuid, 'I have been following this line of work on supply chain analytics for a while, so I''m glad it came up. On our side the development step was the bottleneck, not the main method.', NULL::uuid, '2026-06-11T02:44:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('f5b03686-f3e6-409e-86ea-3f069ea7e16e'::uuid, 'Priya, could you say more about how you handled development? Liability and transparency around supply chain analytics are still unsettled, and this paper does not address them. We reproduced part of this for supply chain analytics and the trend held, although the absolute numbers were lower.', '120361f9-0430-4302-8784-37465281bd57'::uuid, '2026-06-12T09:21:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('5e5de0c9-f52a-455c-8ed7-44836236cac9'::uuid, 'Good point, Yash; I had not considered that angle on supply chain analytics. There is a useful parallel with signal processing, where the role of intangible supply chain analytical is comparable.', 'f5b03686-f3e6-409e-86ea-3f069ea7e16e'::uuid, '2026-06-12T15:08:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('c0d03990-d707-4736-a073-723d54977b4d'::uuid, 'Good point, Yash; I had not considered that angle on supply chain analytics. In a small pilot, the approach worked well on clean data and degraded quickly on messy real-world input. My main concern is whether the evaluation reflects realistic conditions for supply chain analytics.', 'f5b03686-f3e6-409e-86ea-3f069ea7e16e'::uuid, '2026-06-12T19:59:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
