  ('8550aa8c-2dd7-4bdc-bd61-05aa9342750d'::uuid, 'I tried reproducing a small part of this and had mixed results.', NULL::uuid, '2026-09-19T17:32:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('f09915a0-c236-49ea-9750-52a5877bfd28'::uuid, 'Interesting thread. My first reaction is that the RIS irs-aided wireless systems piece is doing most of the heavy lifting here. On our side the signal processing techniques step was the bottleneck, not the main method. A cleaner experiment might isolate RIS irs-aided wireless systems and keep everything else fixed.', NULL::uuid, '2026-09-28T12:14:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('12489b21-0e9d-41f8-871d-d0fc32777017'::uuid, 'Imran, could you say more about how you handled RIS irs-aided wireless systems?', 'f09915a0-c236-49ea-9750-52a5877bfd28'::uuid, '2026-09-29T02:10:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('129abd5d-5fd5-4f7f-9ffd-6e692e786119'::uuid, 'I skimmed “A Survey on Model Compression for Large Language Models” last week, and the framing of model compression is the part I would discuss first. We saw noticeable sensitivity to random seeds, so I would report results over several runs. The recent papers in our library on media studies would make a good companion read. I would be glad to discuss this at the next group meeting.', NULL::uuid, '2026-11-08T22:11:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('33093d56-2b77-4ab6-ab84-e2eae3c77d53'::uuid, 'Good point, Pooja; I had not considered that angle on large language models. How does this compare with last year''s work on VLSI design? It is not clear how much of the improvement comes from model compression versus simply more tuning.', '129abd5d-5fd5-4f7f-9ffd-6e692e786119'::uuid, '2026-11-11T01:50:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
