  ('9da7a747-6d15-43d8-833b-2f702ddf75f4'::uuid, 'Nice find, and a good reminder that the computer vision-based bridge inspection question deserves more attention than it gets. There is a useful parallel with consumer behavior, where the role of monitoring is comparable.', NULL::uuid, '2026-08-28T06:06:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
