  ('c744f311-2977-4f35-aee7-4bb9105e6a66'::uuid, 'I think the interesting part of “Computer Vision-Based Bridge Inspection and Monitoring” is less the headline number and more how it handles monitoring. Public-facing claims about computer vision-based bridge inspection deserve careful wording, since non-specialists will read them very differently.', NULL::uuid, '2026-09-06T18:07:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
