  ('14cab544-3a67-42d9-bb66-afd7ae411d0d'::uuid, 'Jatin, this is the kind of detail that rarely makes it into the paper. Scalability is the open question; it is unclear how this behaves when the data grows by an order of magnitude. In deployment, noise and quantisation tend to hurt monitoring more than simulation suggests.', '9da7a747-6d15-43d8-833b-2f702ddf75f4'::uuid, '2026-08-30T23:36:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
