  ('78489402-a580-45ef-b2ce-208c477dbaa8'::uuid, 'Honest take: the results look promising, but I would hold off on strong conclusions. In a small pilot, the approach worked well on clean data and degraded quickly on messy real-world input. I would be cautious about generalising beyond the datasets reported in the paper.', NULL::uuid, '2026-10-30T23:15:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('7a4536df-5ac9-43bc-8154-7b04e99fbf4a'::uuid, 'I skimmed “CYBER SECURITY AND DATA PRIVACY LAW IN PAKISTAN” last week, and the framing of PROTECTING INFORMATION is the part I would discuss first. How does this compare with last year''s work on wireless sensor networks? Related reading: surveys on wireless sensor networks cover the background on DATA PRIVACY LAW nicely.', NULL::uuid, '2026-06-09T07:14:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('c7168159-ad01-4bee-83f1-ccdbf43e2fc6'::uuid, 'The limitations section is thin, especially regarding PROTECTING INFORMATION.', NULL::uuid, '2026-06-15T05:38:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('1718ce71-4ee4-4369-8468-b3cae031f2f5'::uuid, 'Appreciate you sharing this with the group. From a statistical point of view, I would want to see uncertainty estimates around the data privacy law results, not only point values.', NULL::uuid, '2026-06-12T23:59:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('2628cd75-917b-4d2f-9a42-3336de42e5b3'::uuid, 'Short answer from my side: it depends heavily on the data you start with. My main concern is whether the evaluation reflects realistic conditions for embedded systems.', NULL::uuid, '2026-08-18T09:16:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
