  ('a2b3a108-6d36-4e1d-a051-70822e370641'::uuid, 'That is a fair summary, Divya, but one detail about embedded systems is missing. I would be cautious about generalising beyond the datasets reported in the paper.', '177ae5e9-3e78-4db1-a0b9-ea4b1b4880bf'::uuid, '2026-08-17T03:50:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('ac0047e7-4096-4d9e-9c5e-09aaa8a58613'::uuid, 'Thanks Divya, that clarifies the ECG monitoring embedded system part for me.', '177ae5e9-3e78-4db1-a0b9-ea4b1b4880bf'::uuid, '2026-08-16T11:57:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('9cb219c1-cac5-4a5c-b81a-16228db5407b'::uuid, 'This is a timely question, and we ran into something similar while working on embedded systems. From a statistical point of view, I would want to see uncertainty estimates around the embedded systems results, not only point values.', NULL::uuid, '2026-08-11T16:51:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('2efc7951-75f5-4b16-972b-04cc9671e8e3'::uuid, 'Worth discussing properly, because the topic of embedded systems keeps coming up in our seminars. Adoption is usually limited by process and incentives, so any plan to adopt embedded systems needs a realistic rollout story. Last semester''s reading group went through “TinyML-Based Classification in an ECG Monitoring Embedded System”, and most of the debate centred on ECG monitoring embedded system. Happy to share my notes if that helps.', NULL::uuid, '2026-08-12T15:51:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('c5df0cc2-03e2-4ba8-928c-28ab198cad7c'::uuid, 'Great discussion starter; the core idea around ECG monitoring embedded system is easy to underestimate. This connects to the work on graph neural networks, which tackles a similar trade-off from a different direction.', NULL::uuid, '2026-08-21T05:48:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('37068b69-772a-4c8f-8345-b6516e99da74'::uuid, 'I think the interesting part of “Trans Media Studies. Einleitung in den Schwerpunkt” is less the headline number and more how it handles den schwerpunkt. It may help to add a qualitative error analysis alongside the headline metrics.', NULL::uuid, '2026-06-10T23:40:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('3bafb02a-a778-4f30-a201-5f53c93c2881'::uuid, 'Great discussion starter; the core idea around den schwerpunkt is easy to underestimate. We saw noticeable sensitivity to random seeds, so I would report results over several runs. How sensitive is it to the choice of hyperparameters? Happy to share my notes if that helps.', NULL::uuid, '2026-06-02T18:18:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('17ceaa4b-d710-42f7-a134-f1f8a0f97c01'::uuid, 'I think the interesting part of the paper is less the headline number and more how it handles den schwerpunkt. I would like to see a simple analytical baseline for trans media studies einleitung before trusting the more elaborate method.', NULL::uuid, '2026-06-08T12:13:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('ab4b2135-697b-47f4-9f47-504d47e8803a'::uuid, 'Anjali, could you say more about how you handled trans media studies einleitung? In a small pilot, the approach worked well on clean data and degraded quickly on messy real-world input. It is not clear how much of the improvement comes from trans media studies einleitung versus simply more tuning.', '17ceaa4b-d710-42f7-a134-f1f8a0f97c01'::uuid, '2026-06-09T14:19:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('46f25cd8-278e-4760-9dee-dac9bbcb4b8d'::uuid, 'Short answer from my side: it depends heavily on the data you start with. Is there a public dataset we could use to test trans media studies einleitung ourselves? The social context of media studies is largely absent here, and I think it changes how we should read the findings. Let me know if a joint write-up would be useful.', NULL::uuid, '2026-06-02T11:10:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('973e5071-48c1-44b2-ab59-b89d2623626b'::uuid, 'Consider tracking trans media studies einleitung separately so that regressions are easier to spot.', NULL::uuid, '2026-06-02T20:47:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('70da5a5d-e282-480c-97c6-a21ee49d0936'::uuid, 'I would gently disagree, Anjali: the evidence for trans media studies einleitung is thinner than it looks. Several of the reported gains are small enough that they could disappear under a different split.', '17ceaa4b-d710-42f7-a134-f1f8a0f97c01'::uuid, '2026-06-08T22:16:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
