  ('1b7095e4-ecc5-42b3-84ab-bb164f603e99'::uuid, 'Nice find, and a good reminder that the cognitive psychology question deserves more attention than it gets. If you are open to it, we could draft a short comparison note for the reading group. It would be worth asking whose perspective is missing from the data behind cognitive psychology. Sharing a few references in the group folder later this week.', NULL::uuid, '2026-08-08T01:51:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('7bddaf26-d5e3-4983-a7c8-06765848511c'::uuid, 'Worth a closer look when we plan the next cognitive psychology project.', NULL::uuid, '2026-08-10T07:35:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('b7436a19-16c1-4fb1-8b90-8fddfadeca14'::uuid, 'Gaurav, could you say more about how you handled cognitive psychology? Is the code or the exact configuration available so we can reproduce the cognitive psychology results? From a legal standpoint, how cognitive psychology is documented will matter if the results are ever challenged. I would be glad to discuss this at the next group meeting.', '7bddaf26-d5e3-4983-a7c8-06765848511c'::uuid, '2026-08-11T11:14:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('c7508e83-99e6-42b5-bc94-9dc5474aefcd'::uuid, 'Great discussion starter; the core idea around DIGITALIZATION is easy to underestimate. Has anyone compared this against a simple baseline for consumer behavior?', NULL::uuid, '2026-11-04T17:44:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('1b7b2602-af22-445f-82f1-498f0efc8898'::uuid, 'Helpful context, Charulatha. Related reading: surveys on digital humanities cover the background on ECONOMY nicely.', 'c7508e83-99e6-42b5-bc94-9dc5474aefcd'::uuid, '2026-11-06T11:54:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('dd09168f-94c7-421e-93a2-14fce6bc75f7'::uuid, 'Charulatha, this is the kind of detail that rarely makes it into the paper. Several of the reported gains are small enough that they could disappear under a different split. It would help to state the assumptions behind DIGITALIZATION formally and check which of them actually hold. Looking forward to hearing what others think.', 'c7508e83-99e6-42b5-bc94-9dc5474aefcd'::uuid, '2026-11-04T19:40:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('a13d3438-9c0a-471f-aca9-f85f9cf1c58d'::uuid, 'Helpful context, Charulatha. It would help to see how CONSUMER BEHAVIOR performs for smaller organisations with limited data.', 'c7508e83-99e6-42b5-bc94-9dc5474aefcd'::uuid, '2026-11-05T05:13:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('efe49bd8-2386-4938-a763-4d3da6502f9d'::uuid, 'Interesting thread. My first reaction is that the CONTEXT piece is doing most of the heavy lifting here. I worry the benchmark is too close to the training setup to say much about consumer behavior in the wild.', NULL::uuid, '2026-11-08T09:42:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('43faafe0-034c-49b1-bf91-84dea023771a'::uuid, 'Nice find, and a good reminder that the DIGITALIZATION question deserves more attention than it gets. Is there a public dataset we could use to test CONTEXT ourselves? A sensitivity analysis would show how stable the conclusions about consumer behavior are to small changes in the data.', NULL::uuid, '2026-10-29T04:15:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('aed5a405-2ceb-4611-b052-4b85984cd57b'::uuid, 'I would gently disagree, Charulatha: the evidence for CONSUMER BEHAVIOR is thinner than it looks.', 'c7508e83-99e6-42b5-bc94-9dc5474aefcd'::uuid, '2026-11-07T14:46:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('848e4a9e-2837-43de-97b1-a7a960bba07d'::uuid, 'I tried reproducing a small part of this and had mixed results. In our group we used ECONOMY on a small consumer behavior dataset, and the gains were modest but consistent. Several of the reported gains are small enough that they could disappear under a different split.', NULL::uuid, '2026-11-08T07:32:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('2f4c8f49-95ff-444d-859c-06b9b0216823'::uuid, 'Interesting thread. My first reaction is that the CONTEXT piece is doing most of the heavy lifting here. How sensitive is it to the choice of hyperparameters? The recent papers in our library on CRISPR gene editing would make a good companion read.', NULL::uuid, '2026-10-29T02:47:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('fae1f3ec-4b0b-4cf2-b1f8-7a92cf89601d'::uuid, 'Honest take: the results look promising, but I would hold off on strong conclusions. Scalability is the open question; it is unclear how this behaves when the data grows by an order of magnitude.', NULL::uuid, '2026-06-03T16:38:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
