  ('1cabb868-d672-460d-a85d-1d09b9da211d'::uuid, 'Good point, Aditya; I had not considered that angle on wireless sensor networks. In a small pilot, the approach worked well on clean data and degraded quickly on messy real-world input. It would help to see how security issues performs for smaller organisations with limited data. Keen to see follow-up results.', 'a5a5267b-ae6d-4092-875c-cc512d1543ec'::uuid, '2026-06-01T13:47:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz)
