  ('1d76c3f3-25b0-4b45-8e3b-1e4e9fc186fd'::uuid, 'Tanvi, could you say more about how you handled anomaly detection? It is not clear how much of the improvement comes from rethinking graph neural networks versus simply more tuning.', 'c7403a04-fd0a-477d-9f4e-e7476fc16f9c'::uuid, '2026-07-08T19:16:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('743fa6dd-2ddc-4874-83c4-506f406f21bd'::uuid, 'Nice find, and a good reminder that the virulent bacteriophage ICP question deserves more attention than it gets. When we tried a similar setup for CRISPR gene editing, preprocessing choices changed the outcome more than the model did.', NULL::uuid, '2026-07-09T05:00:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('b97e6f78-7cd7-4176-acc4-14604ed73dc0'::uuid, 'The limitations section is thin, especially regarding virulent bacteriophage ICP.', NULL::uuid, '2026-07-02T05:33:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('91acc813-af9d-4fbc-b09c-8bde6dd0b1bc'::uuid, 'Honest take: the results look promising, but I would hold off on strong conclusions. Did you check how it performs when the input around virulent bacteriophage ICP is noisy or partially missing? I would want evidence that virulent bacteriophage ICP translates into measurable business outcomes, not only better metrics.', NULL::uuid, '2026-07-05T22:56:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('1d7a99eb-062d-48d2-b9fc-5a3f62b630e6'::uuid, 'Thanks for bringing this up; “CRISPR Gene Editing of Virulent Bacteriophage ICP1” is a useful lens on CRISPR gene editing. There is a useful parallel with computer vision, where the role of virulent bacteriophage ICP is comparable. What would it take to adapt this to a different domain, say computer vision? Looking forward to hearing what others think.', NULL::uuid, '2026-07-04T13:37:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('9e57ae1e-8fc4-4041-87dd-0fdc723cc47d'::uuid, 'Interesting thread. My first reaction is that the virulent bacteriophage ICP piece is doing most of the heavy lifting here. The biological interpretation of virulent bacteriophage ICP is where I would be most careful. Do the authors say anything about computational cost for virulent bacteriophage ICP?', NULL::uuid, '2026-07-01T04:09:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('38bce6cb-05b7-4322-a72e-1c479de4e445'::uuid, 'I skimmed “Narrative explanation in media studies” last week, and the framing of narrative explanation is the part I would discuss first. Which metric did you prioritise, and does the ranking change if you pick another one? There is a useful parallel with digital humanities, where the role of narrative explanation is comparable.', NULL::uuid, '2026-05-31T06:21:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
