  ('4cb2fd22-cd53-4440-afd1-8505c2575fbb'::uuid, 'I think the interesting part of the paper is less the headline number and more how it handles deep learning. It may help to add a qualitative error analysis alongside the headline metrics. It would be worth asking whose perspective is missing from the data behind deep learning. Keen to see follow-up results.', NULL::uuid, '2026-09-04T22:25:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('887d4d25-63d8-42bc-bb0f-1ddf98940d9f'::uuid, 'I skimmed “Animal behavior classification via deep learning on embedded systems” last week, and the framing of animal behavior classification is the part I would discuss first. Public-facing claims about deep learning deserve careful wording, since non-specialists will read them very differently. The limitations section is thin, especially regarding animal behavior classification.', NULL::uuid, '2026-09-04T03:29:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('20e749c1-b8a3-402c-84a8-be4242e8d025'::uuid, 'Thanks for bringing this up; “Animal behavior classification via deep learning on embedded systems” is a useful lens on embedded systems. There is a useful parallel with media studies, where the role of animal behavior classification is comparable. It would be worth asking whose perspective is missing from the data behind deep learning. I will revisit this after I have had time to run a few experiments.', NULL::uuid, '2026-09-10T09:43:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('e73ca568-8197-4e7e-ae48-ca902254cf26'::uuid, 'I have been following this line of work on embedded systems for a while, so I''m glad it came up. On the hardware side, any embedded systems pipeline would have to fit a tight power and latency budget, so I would profile it on a real board. On our side the animal behavior classification step was the bottleneck, not the main method. Happy to share my notes if that helps.', NULL::uuid, '2026-09-02T20:13:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
