  ('580ab220-a983-4583-a9a1-7a2f526b6f13'::uuid, 'Helpful context, Vikram. In a small pilot, the approach worked well on clean data and degraded quickly on messy real-world input. It could be worth pairing this with ideas from VLSI design; the overlap with NPK sensor implementations looks real.', 'd02b2c7c-e890-4116-a75a-8bc2e26ed4d6'::uuid, '2026-09-01T06:55:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
