  ('247f7e9c-fde0-4b3f-be2c-1e9d00702edc'::uuid, 'I see it a little differently, Kunal. This connects to the work on cyber law, which tackles a similar trade-off from a different direction. My main concern is whether the evaluation reflects realistic conditions for wireless sensor networks. Looking forward to hearing what others think.', '8a3c8558-8dda-4e70-b1b2-dcce282a245f'::uuid, '2026-06-07T22:39:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('2f7b515b-ca09-4e87-b97c-96fc01f1b192'::uuid, 'Thanks Manish, that clarifies the g communication- part for me. It would help to see how green networking performs for smaller organisations with limited data. Has anyone compared this against a simple baseline for wireless sensor networks? Looking forward to hearing what others think.', '80c6ef7f-a06e-44b4-8f52-28cf3062bc55'::uuid, '2026-06-10T06:48:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
