  ('2a1ba189-63cc-4894-a6a3-33e16576fd2e'::uuid, 'This lines up with what we have seen when applying CRISPR gene editing in practice. Has anyone compared this against a simple baseline for CRISPR gene editing? When we tried a similar setup for CRISPR gene editing, preprocessing choices changed the outcome more than the model did. Looking forward to hearing what others think.', NULL::uuid, '2026-10-15T07:35:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('72728038-cdf1-4300-8178-f27120afd0f1'::uuid, 'Quick note before the details: I''m reading this mostly from a law and policy point of view. We reproduced part of this for CRISPR gene editing and the trend held, although the absolute numbers were lower.', NULL::uuid, '2026-10-18T19:42:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('d649c98c-7967-4c1c-9571-07975b2a975c'::uuid, 'Building on Zoya''s comment, the vectors assumption matters a lot here. How does this compare with last year''s work on data mining? The limitations section is thin, especially regarding neurological disorders.', '72728038-cdf1-4300-8178-f27120afd0f1'::uuid, '2026-10-21T17:34:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('94c34732-8608-47fc-b3f1-6e99b462dd1b'::uuid, 'Did you check how it performs when the input around challenges is noisy or partially missing?', NULL::uuid, '2026-10-14T05:39:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('b02473cc-af86-4230-b8e3-d27861f83eb5'::uuid, 'Appreciate the pointers, Keerthana; I will try that on my next run. How sensitive is it to the choice of hyperparameters? There is a useful parallel with computer vision, where the role of vectors is comparable.', '94c34732-8608-47fc-b3f1-6e99b462dd1b'::uuid, '2026-10-14T14:06:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('c5abff7e-bc5a-46d6-abcb-46afe753002b'::uuid, 'This is a timely question, and we ran into something similar while working on cognitive psychology. This connects to the work on computer vision, which tackles a similar trade-off from a different direction.', NULL::uuid, '2026-05-27T08:44:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('f5b879d7-ed47-407a-a6d2-4a6e7a24f1ba'::uuid, 'Keerthana, could you say more about how you handled cognitive psychology? On our side the cognitive psychology step was the bottleneck, not the main method. It is not clear how much of the improvement comes from cognitive psychology versus simply more tuning.', 'c5abff7e-bc5a-46d6-abcb-46afe753002b'::uuid, '2026-05-28T10:53:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('b81141ad-2b6a-4457-855c-da5d3fb62e1d'::uuid, 'Keerthana, could you say more about how you handled cognitive psychology? I worry the benchmark is too close to the training setup to say much about cognitive psychology in the wild. It may help to add a qualitative error analysis alongside the headline metrics. I would be glad to discuss this at the next group meeting.', 'c5abff7e-bc5a-46d6-abcb-46afe753002b'::uuid, '2026-05-29T10:56:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz)
