  ('49e634bb-20d8-4efc-a5fa-ba724588c9c1'::uuid, 'Thanks for bringing this up; the paper is a useful lens on cognitive psychology. Do the authors say anything about computational cost for COGNITIVE PSYCHOLOGY? I would suggest a pilot on a small subset first, then scale up if the cognitive psychology results hold. Sharing a few references in the group folder later this week.', NULL::uuid, '2026-10-20T23:40:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
