  ('ea9ad88f-93f1-4a0d-842e-b8d5443523c4'::uuid, 'Thanks Charulatha, that clarifies the data privacy laws part for me. From a legal standpoint, how africa s data privacy is documented will matter if the results are ever challenged.', 'b7cac93d-be6b-4aef-9276-fe875c37e729'::uuid, '2026-07-30T10:20:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('dc047cf7-ef79-4f5d-9978-3d78e0b5d3a6'::uuid, 'Appreciate you sharing this with the group. Adoption is usually limited by process and incentives, so any plan to adopt data privacy law needs a realistic rollout story.', NULL::uuid, '2026-08-01T15:54:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('3a5df34c-1268-47da-8018-799a28ca8109'::uuid, 'I skimmed the paper last week, and the framing of data privacy laws is the part I would discuss first. It is not clear how much of the improvement comes from africa s data privacy versus simply more tuning. If you are open to it, we could draft a short comparison note for the reading group. Keen to see follow-up results.', NULL::uuid, '2026-07-25T23:09:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('649bd427-59a7-4927-a99a-77c28e680e51'::uuid, 'I think the interesting part of the paper is less the headline number and more how it handles selected african countries. We saw noticeable sensitivity to random seeds, so I would report results over several runs.', NULL::uuid, '2026-07-29T13:01:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('2b1a2452-8331-410b-8abd-3ed916475509'::uuid, 'Short answer from my side: it depends heavily on the data you start with. It is not clear how much of the improvement comes from africa s data privacy versus simply more tuning. Last semester''s reading group went through “Africa''s Data Privacy Puzzle”, and most of the debate centred on selected african countries. I would be glad to discuss this at the next group meeting.', NULL::uuid, '2026-07-28T10:30:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('b4f1810b-39da-47b8-b1e8-3f0c9055b681'::uuid, 'Good point, Aarav; I had not considered that angle on data privacy law. What would it take to adapt this to a different domain, say sustainable finance? In our group we used selected african countries on a small data privacy law dataset, and the gains were modest but consistent.', '3a5df34c-1268-47da-8018-799a28ca8109'::uuid, '2026-07-26T02:01:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
