  ('dca41bd9-151a-40dd-be1d-167478ac3b1b'::uuid, 'Good question. I read “A Tutorial on Extremely Large-Scale MIMO for 6G” a few weeks ago and it has stayed with me. What would it take to adapt this to a different domain, say VLSI design? Scalability is the open question; it is unclear how this behaves when the data grows by an order of magnitude. Happy to share my notes if that helps.', NULL::uuid, '2026-06-24T17:18:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
