  ('7506034f-03b6-4e1c-bc4c-f2b6cd01d783'::uuid, 'Good question. I read “Embedded Systems” a few weeks ago and it has stayed with me. A sensitivity analysis would show how stable the conclusions about embedded systems are to small changes in the data.', NULL::uuid, '2026-10-31T00:12:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
