  ('c82fef57-a18a-4c6f-9f21-cbeec18ba3ee'::uuid, 'That is a fair summary, Nikhil, but one detail about embedded systems is missing. Do the authors say anything about computational cost for embedded systems? Scalability is the open question; it is unclear how this behaves when the data grows by an order of magnitude. Sharing a few references in the group folder later this week.', '7506034f-03b6-4e1c-bc4c-f2b6cd01d783'::uuid, '2026-10-31T18:36:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('9dfdee1d-0b12-4dd9-bae0-9bc249b892c8'::uuid, 'Worth discussing properly, because the topic of embedded systems keeps coming up in our seminars. It is not clear how much of the improvement comes from embedded systems versus simply more tuning.', NULL::uuid, '2026-11-03T20:32:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('3f71e4be-b63a-47f7-aef5-a17046ac5b53'::uuid, 'Kavya, could you say more about how you handled embedded systems? I would be cautious about generalising beyond the datasets reported in the paper. How sensitive is it to the choice of hyperparameters? I would be glad to discuss this at the next group meeting.', '9dfdee1d-0b12-4dd9-bae0-9bc249b892c8'::uuid, '2026-11-04T17:45:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('5fef960a-40ab-479b-8084-cfa648f41b16'::uuid, 'This is a timely question, and we ran into something similar while working on embedded systems. Which metric did you prioritise, and does the ranking change if you pick another one?', NULL::uuid, '2026-11-01T03:39:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('44e6bb73-36a9-4723-abf3-fd7ff67a787a'::uuid, 'Great discussion starter; the core idea around digital humanities is easy to underestimate. Liability and transparency around digital humanities are still unsettled, and this paper does not address them. Our lab has been collecting notes on digital humanities; the picture is more nuanced than the abstract suggests. Keen to see follow-up results.', NULL::uuid, '2026-09-21T13:47:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('b8b9bcd3-01ea-49d2-ae48-e032ba192818'::uuid, 'Fair objection, Ishita, though I think it depends on the dataset. One option is to run a small ablation on digital humanities and share the numbers with the group. Did you check how it performs when the input around digital humanities is noisy or partially missing?', '44e6bb73-36a9-4723-abf3-fd7ff67a787a'::uuid, '2026-09-22T19:54:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('d3ed58b8-53ca-4d78-8b22-b749818e536c'::uuid, 'Honest take: the results look promising, but I would hold off on strong conclusions. There is a useful parallel with CRISPR gene editing, where the role of digital humanities is comparable.', NULL::uuid, '2026-09-26T18:06:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
