  ('90296ed4-eb5d-4d7c-ac8e-cee04120c7a1'::uuid, 'That is a fair summary, Sneha, but one detail about artificial intelligence regulation is missing. The recent papers in our library on VLSI design would make a good companion read.', 'adaa14ea-671b-4d61-aa3f-4b2a7c5dcffe'::uuid, '2026-07-15T16:43:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
