  ('4539e1ed-58c1-41a8-9cf5-194faa2f045d'::uuid, 'This is a timely question, and we ran into something similar while working on large language models. A colleague''s project on large language models hit the same issue with reasoning.', NULL::uuid, '2026-09-08T18:33:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('49840860-eb88-4553-83c9-675ca1ed2e16'::uuid, 'Great discussion starter; the core idea around wireless sensor network is easy to underestimate. My main concern is whether the evaluation reflects realistic conditions for wireless sensor networks. One option is to run a small ablation on wireless sensor network and share the numbers with the group. I would be glad to discuss this at the next group meeting.', NULL::uuid, '2026-06-20T21:00:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('45f97487-b44e-4abb-aa81-4a0d64db39e8'::uuid, 'I have been following this line of work on wireless sensor networks for a while, so I''m glad it came up. Adoption is usually limited by process and incentives, so any plan to adopt wireless sensor networks needs a realistic rollout story. Last semester''s reading group went through “Internet of things based wireless sensor network”, and most of the debate centred on internet. I will revisit this after I have had time to run a few experiments.', NULL::uuid, '2026-06-19T19:21:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('c67c42b3-0463-44c6-ac89-c5fd533edb15'::uuid, 'Honest take: the results look promising, but I would hold off on strong conclusions. How sensitive is it to the choice of hyperparameters? It could be worth pairing this with ideas from public policy; the overlap with internet looks real.', NULL::uuid, '2026-06-20T15:17:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('4612f81a-1044-48b8-b6fe-9106baa1f989'::uuid, 'I think the interesting part of “The TRiCky Business of Protein Folding in Health and…” is less the headline number and more how it handles disease. I would like to see a simple analytical baseline for tricky business before trusting the more elaborate method.', NULL::uuid, '2026-07-27T17:09:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
