  ('894665cb-cc8e-482c-98f8-3a1a50ba7c20'::uuid, 'Great discussion starter; the core idea around wireless sensor network is easy to underestimate. The recent papers in our library on protein folding would make a good companion read. I worry the benchmark is too close to the training setup to say much about wireless sensor networks in the wild.', NULL::uuid, '2026-08-19T05:27:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
