  ('e4acc3f4-48d8-45ab-b1ed-4f1150c8144e'::uuid, 'I skimmed “Introduction to The Data Mining Techniques in Cybersecurity” last week, and the framing of data mining techniques is the part I would discuss first. A sensitivity analysis would show how stable the conclusions about data mining are to small changes in the data.', NULL::uuid, '2026-10-10T05:50:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('4921c673-8c69-4f0c-976f-2396d0d1b4e3'::uuid, 'Worth discussing properly, because the topic of data mining keeps coming up in our seminars. It would help to see how data mining techniques performs for smaller organisations with limited data. I worry the benchmark is too close to the training setup to say much about data mining in the wild.', NULL::uuid, '2026-10-11T13:23:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('7916f1bd-e3da-48cd-b771-c7bcf3a0c1c3'::uuid, 'I have been following this line of work on data mining for a while, so I''m glad it came up. A cleaner experiment might isolate data mining techniques and keep everything else fixed. In our group we used cybersecurity on a small data mining dataset, and the gains were modest but consistent. Happy to share my notes if that helps.', NULL::uuid, '2026-10-13T08:44:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('89a484e4-1197-4cfc-b7a0-000b04efb603'::uuid, 'I have been following this line of work on consumer behavior for a while, so I''m glad it came up. Is the code or the exact configuration available so we can reproduce the religious values results? We saw noticeable sensitivity to random seeds, so I would report results over several runs.', NULL::uuid, '2026-08-29T11:23:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('879a184a-fbad-4f84-ac34-299fe634e2df'::uuid, 'I have been following this line of work on consumer behavior for a while, so I''m glad it came up. Scalability is the open question; it is unclear how this behaves when the data grows by an order of magnitude. In a small pilot, the approach worked well on clean data and degraded quickly on messy real-world input. Keen to see follow-up results.', NULL::uuid, '2026-09-01T17:37:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
