  ('532d29bb-8e89-4a22-805a-3dbb35a3e742'::uuid, 'Great discussion starter; the core idea around situated practices is easy to underestimate. How sensitive is it to the choice of hyperparameters? It could be worth pairing this with ideas from embedded systems; the overlap with situated practices looks real.', NULL::uuid, '2026-09-24T04:32:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('d2dd8782-e2c6-45db-932a-01d93060bdd8'::uuid, 'Great discussion starter; the core idea around lab book is easy to underestimate. I worry the benchmark is too close to the training setup to say much about media studies in the wild.', NULL::uuid, '2026-09-20T21:36:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('e8a10a53-6487-4b46-a4bb-169aa5958c34'::uuid, 'Good question. I read the paper a few weeks ago and it has stayed with me. I would be cautious about generalising beyond the datasets reported in the paper. From a statistical point of view, I would want to see uncertainty estimates around the media studies results, not only point values.', NULL::uuid, '2026-09-22T20:56:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('d483986e-1ec3-4484-8c83-c507512b2f41'::uuid, 'Thanks Nandini, that clarifies the situated practices part for me. The limitations section is thin, especially regarding lab book.', 'e8a10a53-6487-4b46-a4bb-169aa5958c34'::uuid, '2026-09-23T07:15:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('c071f2c2-5af8-42e1-a6c5-45c5d8a16aa1'::uuid, 'I tried reproducing a small part of this and had mixed results. It could be worth pairing this with ideas from VLSI design; the overlap with multiethnic digital humanities looks real. I would be cautious about generalising beyond the datasets reported in the paper.', NULL::uuid, '2026-09-10T00:07:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('8cb587d6-9336-4f73-90c4-c9e2ab136369'::uuid, 'This lines up with what we have seen when applying digital humanities in practice. In a small pilot, the approach worked well on clean data and degraded quickly on messy real-world input.', NULL::uuid, '2026-09-13T11:26:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('564b54ef-0c62-4a79-8ec6-29b638026345'::uuid, 'Honest take: the results look promising, but I would hold off on strong conclusions. It would help to see how multiethnic digital humanities performs for smaller organisations with limited data. One option is to run a small ablation on multiethnic digital humanities and share the numbers with the group. Keen to see follow-up results.', NULL::uuid, '2026-09-13T06:49:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('5784ccff-7136-456f-8883-1b6ed8aba7ff'::uuid, 'Nice find, and a good reminder that the computer vision applications question deserves more attention than it gets. How does this compare with last year''s work on signal processing?', NULL::uuid, '2026-10-16T18:54:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('f54b5854-509d-43ea-9d60-ca7a89b954e5'::uuid, 'Agreed with Anjali on the main point. Which metric did you prioritise, and does the ranking change if you pick another one? Our lab has been collecting notes on computer vision applications; the picture is more nuanced than the abstract suggests.', '5784ccff-7136-456f-8883-1b6ed8aba7ff'::uuid, '2026-10-19T09:08:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
