  ('62d8c2b4-848a-44eb-97d8-de3b5f58eb15'::uuid, 'Thanks Karthik, that clarifies the embedded systems basics part for me. One option is to run a small ablation on embedded systems basics and share the numbers with the group.', '797db871-2526-4237-9780-ec84e486d388'::uuid, '2026-10-24T08:00:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
