  ('aec16a23-4a11-4411-9b7f-ff34570140eb'::uuid, 'I would gently disagree, Rutuja: the evidence for embedded systems basics is thinner than it looks. On the hardware side, any embedded systems pipeline would have to fit a tight power and latency budget, so I would profile it on a real board. Did you check how it performs when the input around embedded systems basics is noisy or partially missing?', 'd95c31f0-e44b-47fb-8b49-cb4024592d7a'::uuid, '2026-10-27T07:13:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('585f582e-3754-43bf-9409-4517dc447a19'::uuid, 'Tanvi, could you say more about how you handled embedded systems basics? This connects to the work on fintech adoption, which tackles a similar trade-off from a different direction. There is a regulatory angle here: work on embedded systems raises questions about data governance, consent and accountability that we should map early. I would be glad to discuss this at the next group meeting.', '62d8c2b4-848a-44eb-97d8-de3b5f58eb15'::uuid, '2026-10-24T18:29:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
