  ('7a424fcb-b030-42ad-a44f-8b56331e4847'::uuid, 'Mallika, that matches my experience too. I would like to see a simple analytical baseline for synthetic biology approach before trusting the more elaborate method. It may help to add a qualitative error analysis alongside the headline metrics. Happy to share my notes if that helps.', 'e774a97c-dd7b-44ec-a0fe-3183e710dc98'::uuid, '2026-09-25T17:53:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
