  ('7adbc8a0-d0a3-46b3-9331-db1be182ea31'::uuid, 'Great discussion starter; the core idea around beginner s guide is easy to underestimate. Last semester''s reading group went through “A beginner’s guide to bioinformatics”, and most of the debate centred on beginner s guide. A cleaner experiment might isolate beginner s guide and keep everything else fixed. I would be glad to discuss this at the next group meeting.', NULL::uuid, '2026-10-04T04:51:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('7c660ce1-1ad9-4353-8561-8bb702ef3833'::uuid, 'Honest take: the results look promising, but I would hold off on strong conclusions. A sensitivity analysis would show how stable the conclusions about bioinformatics are to small changes in the data. It is not clear how much of the improvement comes from empowering beginners versus simply more tuning. I would be glad to discuss this at the next group meeting.', NULL::uuid, '2026-07-06T04:59:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('d16b05d1-3d40-4b3d-88d4-a1c4ada57a2a'::uuid, 'Interesting thread. My first reaction is that the empowering beginners piece is doing most of the heavy lifting here. It may help to add a qualitative error analysis alongside the headline metrics.', NULL::uuid, '2026-07-06T04:23:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('b7b295ce-d296-409f-bf3d-2c638fdf8d34'::uuid, 'I skimmed “Verifiable and Practical Compliance for Data Privacy Laws” last week, and the framing of data privacy laws is the part I would discuss first. My main concern is whether the evaluation reflects realistic conditions for data privacy law.', NULL::uuid, '2026-09-16T04:39:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('7c9fb634-29e1-497d-aede-f8c842380928'::uuid, 'This is a timely question, and we ran into something similar while working on data privacy law. One option is to run a small ablation on data privacy laws and share the numbers with the group. Scalability is the open question; it is unclear how this behaves when the data grows by an order of magnitude. Happy to share my notes if that helps.', NULL::uuid, '2026-09-25T12:29:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
  ('8e58a420-6722-4457-b853-efd141137f72'::uuid, 'Short answer from my side: it depends heavily on the data you start with. Reporting confidence intervals would make the claims around bioinformatics easier to trust. It would help to state the assumptions behind bioinformatics formally and check which of them actually hold.', NULL::uuid, '2026-07-09T16:30:02.127571+00:00'::timestamptz::timestamptz),
